WEBVTT

00:00:30.000 --> 00:00:45.179
Not even a goodbye?

00:00:49.679 --> 00:00:50.240
Come on in.

00:00:55.679 --> 00:00:56.980
Blacklisted before I even graduate.

00:00:57.079 --> 00:00:57.939
That's got to be your record.

00:01:00.000 --> 00:01:01.659
I don't know who you ticked off around here,

00:01:01.700 --> 00:01:02.840
but you sure ruffled some feathers.

00:01:04.540 --> 00:01:06.079
