00:01:17.740 --> 00:01:18.659
Tell her I'm on my way.

00:01:21.900 --> 00:01:23.579
Seriously, if there's anything I can ever do...

00:01:23.579 --> 00:01:26.780
Actually, um, it's just a few stories I've been working on.

00:01:26.819 --> 00:01:28.280
I would love for you to take a look at them.

00:01:28.980 --> 00:01:29.939
Chloe, I couldn't print your name.

00:01:30.000 --> 00:01:31.719
I'm in the classifieds right now without catching Al.

00:01:33.060 --> 00:01:34.060
Well, what about a pseudonym?

00:01:35.980 --> 00:01:36.900
She's my cousin.

00:01:37.120 --> 00:01:38.359
She won't mind at all.

00:01:38.799 --> 00:01:40.260
She's not interested in journalism.

00:01:44.060 --> 00:01:44.819
Lois Lane.

00:01:44.819 --> 00:01:44.900
Lois Lane.

00:01:44.900 --> 00:01:46.900
Lois Lane.

00:01:46.900 --> 00:01:48.900
