00:08:54.600 --> 00:08:56.600
Looks like we've all been busy.

00:08:56.600 --> 00:08:57.600
I guess so.

00:08:57.600 --> 00:08:58.600
I guess so.

00:08:58.600 --> 00:09:00.600
Looks like we've all been busy.

