00:18:33.680 --> 00:18:35.599
The brain's hardwired to stay alive.

00:18:35.599 --> 00:18:37.720
I mean, not even hypnotic messages can override

00:18:37.720 --> 00:18:39.940
our survival instincts.

00:18:39.940 --> 00:18:42.700
Don't you just pick that up somewhere?

00:18:42.700 --> 00:18:45.599
I was in physical rehab for months.

00:18:45.599 --> 00:18:46.700
