00:19:08.579 --> 00:19:10.940
Look, I hate to think you wasted a trip to Metropolis,

00:19:10.940 --> 00:19:13.859
but I seriously doubt my father's trying to kill Chloe.

00:19:13.859 --> 00:19:14.759
Why?

00:19:14.759 --> 00:19:18.200
He was willing to put his own son in a mental institution.

00:19:18.200 --> 00:19:19.019
You know what he's capable of.

00:19:19.019 --> 00:19:22.619
Clark, what reason would he have to go after a high school

00:19:22.619 --> 00:19:23.519
reporter from Smallville?

00:19:26.700 --> 00:19:29.920
Is there something you're not telling me?

00:19:29.920 --> 00:19:31.819
Does this have anything to do with the seven weeks of my life

